Package: functionsUnionHealth
Type: Package
Title: Functions for Project "paper-union-wvs"
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Felix", "Forster",
      email = "forsterepi@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3670-9244")
    )
  )
Description: Contains functions used in projects investigating the relation
    between trade unions (trade union density, collective bargaining coverage,
    trade union membership, trade union presence) as well as health and well-
    being. These functions are used in repository "paper-union-wvs" and have 
    been extracted into a separate package so established workflows for testing 
    and documentation can be used.
